"Assegna un segno zodiacale a ogni blocco AstroWay inserito al suo interno."

#: blocks/bodygraph/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Human Design Bodygraph"
msgstr "AstroWay: Bodygraph Human Design"

#: blocks/bodygraph/block.json
msgid "Human Design bodygraph with type, profile, and gates."
msgstr "Bodygraph Human Design con tipo, profilo e porte."

#: blocks/daily-horoscope/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Daily Horoscope"
msgstr "AstroWay: Oroscopo Giornaliero"

#: blocks/daily-horoscope/block.json
msgid "Daily horoscope text for a zodiac sign."
msgstr "Testo dell'oroscopo giornaliero per un segno zodiacale."

#: blocks/daily-tarot/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Daily Tarot"
msgstr "AstroWay: Tarot Giornaliero"

#: blocks/daily-tarot/block.json
msgid "Single-card daily Tarot draw with interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Estrazione giornaliera di una singola carta Tarot con interpretazione."

#: blocks/kundli/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Vedic Kundli"
msgstr "Impostazioni AstroWay"

#: blocks/kundli/block.json
msgid ""
"Vedic North-Indian kundli (D1) chart served by api.astroway.info as a "
"responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Ruota della carta natale fornita da api.astroway.info come iframe "
"responsive."

#: blocks/mini-chart/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Mini Birth Chart"
msgstr "AstroWay: Mini tema natale"

#: blocks/mini-chart/block.json
msgid ""
"The natal wheel drawn small, for a sidebar, served by api.astroway.info as a"
" responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Il tema natale, ridimensionato per essere inserito in una barra laterale, "
"viene fornito da api.astroway.info sotto forma di iframe responsive."

#: blocks/monthly-forecast/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Monthly Forecast"
msgstr "AstroWay: Previsioni mensili"

#: blocks/monthly-forecast/block.json
msgid ""
"Four weeks ahead for one sign, each week with its own theme, served as a "
"responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Per un segno zodiacale, le quattro settimane a venire, ciascuna con un "
"proprio tema, erano presentate in un iframe reattivo."

#: blocks/monthly-horoscope/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Monthly Horoscope"
msgstr "AstroWay: Oroscopo mensile"

#: blocks/monthly-horoscope/block.json
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current month, anchored to the 1st, rendered into the page"
" as text."
msgstr ""
"Oroscopo del mese in corso, con riferimento al 1°, riportato nella pagina "
"sotto forma di testo."

#: blocks/moon-phase/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Moon Phase"
msgstr "AstroWay: Fase Lunare"

#: blocks/moon-phase/block.json
msgid "Current moon phase with illumination percentage."
msgstr "Fase lunare corrente con percentuale di illuminazione."

#: blocks/moon-sign/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Moon Sign"
msgstr "AstroWay: Segno lunare"

#: blocks/moon-sign/block.json
msgid "The Moon's sign, degree and house from a birth chart."
msgstr "Il segno, il grado e la casa della Luna in un tema natale."

#: blocks/natal-chart/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Natal Chart"
msgstr "AstroWay: Carta Natale"

#: blocks/natal-chart/block.json
msgid "Natal chart wheel served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Ruota della carta natale fornita da api.astroway.info come iframe "
"responsive."

#: blocks/numerology/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Numerology"
msgstr "AstroWay: Fase Lunare"

#: blocks/numerology/block.json
msgid ""
"Numerology core numbers (Life Path, Expression, Soul Urge, Personality) "
"served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Ruota della carta natale fornita da api.astroway.info come iframe "
"responsive."

#: blocks/panchang/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Daily Panchang"
msgstr "AstroWay: Tarot Giornaliero"

#: blocks/panchang/block.json
msgid ""
"Daily Panchang (tithi, nakshatra, yoga, karana, vara, rahu-kaal) for a date "
"and location, served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Ruota della carta natale fornita da api.astroway.info come iframe "
"responsive."

#: blocks/planet-of-day/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Planet of the Day"
msgstr "AstroWay: Il pianeta del giorno"

#: blocks/planet-of-day/block.json
msgid ""
"Traditional planetary ruler of the weekday, with its glyph and themes, "
"rendered into the page."
msgstr ""
"Il governatore planetario tradizionale del giorno della settimana, con il "
"suo simbolo e i relativi temi, riportato nella pagina."

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Rising Sign"
msgstr "AstroWay: Segno ascendente"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgid ""
"The rising sign with its chart ruler. Needs coordinates: the ascendant is "
"the horizon at a place."
msgstr ""
"Il segno ascendente con il suo governatore. Sono necessarie le coordinate: "
"l'ascendente corrisponde all'orizzonte in un determinato luogo."

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Synastry Compatibility"
msgstr "AstroWay: Carta Natale"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgid ""
"Synastry compatibility score and top inter-aspects for two birth charts, "
"served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Ruota della carta natale fornita da api.astroway.info come iframe "
"responsive."

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Moon Transit Timeline"
msgstr "AstroWay: Cronologia dei transiti lunari"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgid ""
"The next seven days of Moon ingresses, served by api.astroway.info as a "
"responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"I prossimi sette giorni di ingressi lunari, forniti da api.astroway.info "
"tramite un iframe responsive."

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Transit Sky"
msgstr "AstroWay: Carta Natale"

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgid ""
"Snapshot of the transiting planets' signs and degrees for a date, served by "
"api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Ruota della carta natale fornita da api.astroway.info come iframe "
"responsive."

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Weekly Horoscope"
msgstr "AstroWay: Oroscopo settimanale"

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current week, anchored to Monday, rendered into the page "
"as text."
msgstr ""
"Oroscopo della settimana in corso, con riferimento a lunedì, riportato nella"
" pagina sotto forma di testo."
